"entity": {
"name": "Alm. Brand A/S",
"description": "Alm. Brand A/S is a financial services group, which engages in the provision of insurance. It operates through the following segments: Personal Lines, Commercial Lines, Non-Life Insurance, and Other. The Personal Lines segment comprises the group\u2019s sales of insurance to private households through its own sales channels and partnerships. The Commercial Lines segment focuses on the group\u2019s industrial segment, whose products are mainly sold through partnerships. The Non-Life Insurance segment exclusively targeting the Danish market with a focus on private customers, small and medium-sized enterprises, property owners and administrators, agricultural customers, and the public sector. The Other segment includes corporate functions undertaken by Alm. Brand A/S and the operation of a debt collection and mortgage deed portfolio. The company was founded on February 29, 1792 and is headquartered in Copenhagen, Denmark.",
